On that note, How do we decide when to make a new class? I am counting most "generic" background as just grass. 
But I have special sections for sidewalk and tire marks and construction. 

I feel when I get too specefic, I will introduce issues relating to my own biases, as I have to pick one when a tile may hold more than one.
So I feel simpler is better. 

Perhaps we need to move away from the idea of "Live footage." As currently, especially with the "warmup" period, 
the algorithm makes too many queries to go along with a live system.


